{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #f4c8e0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #33223f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #33223f; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right,transparent 0,transparent 14px,#623c8b19 15px,#623c8b19 18px); border: 2px solid #33223f; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 36px 18px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #33223f; display: block; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e高个性粉紫底纸正面碰撞电光深紫墨块，把独立艺术书展里的孔版印刷张力直接搬上屏幕。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #623c8b; border: 0; color: #ffffff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e不讨好所有人的先锋印刷色\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #33223f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e整页粉紫纸面自带强烈实验气质，让艺术展讯、乐评与创意专题跳出传统排版套路。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #e5a7c9; border: 2px solid #33223f; color: #33223f; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.7; margin: 24px 0; padding: 22px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e鲜明的色彩态度，本身就是创意作品的第一张名片。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/creative-studio.jpg\" alt=\"创意工作台色卡与绘画工具俯拍\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #623c8b; border: 0; color: #ffffff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e孔版印刷风的吸睛法则\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e整页紫粉底色与全库其他 39 套绝不撞色\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e电光深紫粗标题块强化独立杂志节奏\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e极适合插画、摄影、音乐与潮牌推文\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #75516f; color: #33223f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e保持叛逆与新鲜感，下期继续印出好点子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
